sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as You
  participant App as App · PurchaseGateway
  participant RC as RevenueCat + store
  participant WH as revenuecat-webhook
  participant DB as Supabase
  U->>App: paywall → buy
  App->>RC: configure on first paywall open, purchase (app user id = profile id)
  RC-->>App: receipt: pro / cloud
  App->>App: features unlock on this phone at once
  RC->>WH: purchase event
  WH->>DB: apply_store_entitlement(event)
  DB->>DB: store_event ledger (once per event id)<br/>entitlement: cloud + expiry · plus only for one-time products
  App->>DB: my_entitlement()
  DB-->>App: cloud, plus, cloud_tenants
  Note over App,DB: once the server has spoken it outranks the cached receipt for Cloud
